{"id":6746,"mal_id":6746,"title":"Durarara!!","englishTitle":"Durarara!!","title_english":"Durarara!!","alternative_titles":{"synonyms":["Dhurarara!!","Dyurarara!!","Dulalala!!","Dullalala!!","DRRR!!"],"en":"Durarara!!","ja":"デュラララ!!"},"synopsis":"In Tokyo's downtown district of Ikebukuro, amidst many strange rumors and warnings of anonymous gangs and dangerous occupants, one urban legend stands out above the rest—the existence of a headless \"Black Rider\" who is said to be seen driving a jet-black motorcycle through the city streets.\n\nMikado Ryuugamine has always longed for the excitement of the city life, and an invitation from a childhood friend convinces him to move to Tokyo. Witnessing the Black Rider on his first day in the city, his wishes already seem to have been granted. But as supernatural events begin to occur, ordinary citizens like himself, along with Ikebukuro's most colorful inhabitants, are mixed up in the commotion breaking out in their city.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]\n","synopsis_es":"En el distrito de Ikebukuro, en el centro de Tokio, en medio de muchos extraños rumores y advertencias sobre pandillas anónimas y ocupantes peligrosos, una leyenda urbana se destaca por encima del resto: la existencia de un \"Jinete Negro\" sin cabeza a quien se dice que se le ve conduciendo una motocicleta de color negro azabache por las calles de la ciudad.\n\nMikado Ryuugamine siempre ha anhelado la emoción de la vida en la ciudad, y una invitación de un amigo de la infancia lo convence de mudarse a Tokio. Witnessing the Black Rider on his first day in the city, his wishes already seem to have been granted. Pero cuando empiezan a ocurrir acontecimientos sobrenaturales, ciudadanos comunes y corrientes como él, junto con los habitantes más pintorescos de Ikebukuro, se ven envueltos en la conmoción que se desata en su ciudad.\n\n[Escrito por MAL Rewrite]","type":"TV","media_type":"tv","status":"finished_airing","averageEpisodeDurationSeconds":1460,"average_episo